PrivateFrameworks for StretchRes
================================

This directory contains development headers for private frameworks 
required by the StretchRes tweak. These headers are typically obtained 
from the iOS device or Apple Developer website.

Frameworks referenced:
- IOKit: Used for IOMobileGraphicsFamily plist manipulation and 
  display configuration. The IOKit.h header is included in Tweak.x 
  via <IOKit/IOKit.h>.
- BackboardServices: Conceptually used for SpringBoard/backboardd 
  interaction, though the current implementation uses XPC messaging 
  instead of direct framework calls.

Note: Theos provides many of these headers through /opt/theos/include. 
For iOS 15.0–15.8.8 compatibility, ensure you are using headers 
compatible with the target OS version. Do not use iOS 16+ only APIs.

Files in this directory:
- IOKit headers (provided by Theos or device headers)
- BackboardServices headers (if additional framework integration is needed)